@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System
participant "Google Cloud\nVision" as Vision
participant "Spotify" as Spotify

activate User

User -> System: asks to scan an album cover
opt camera permission not yet granted
  System --> User: requests camera permission
  User -> System: grants or denies permission
end
alt permission denied
  System --> User: informs that camera permission is denied
else permission granted
  System --> User: opens the camera

  User -> System: takes a photo of the cover
  alt photo cancelled or unreadable
    System --> User: returns to the main menu
  else photo ok
    System -> Vision: sends the photo for analysis
    Vision --> System: returns the detected text
    alt nothing usable detected
      System --> User: informs that no text was found
    else text detected
      System -> Spotify: searches albums with the detected text
      Spotify --> System: returns up to 10 albums
      alt no albums found
        System --> User: informs that the album was not found
      else best result matches the text
        System --> User: shows the album details
      else several candidates
        System --> User: shows the list of candidate albums

        User -> System: chooses an album
        System --> User: shows the album details
      end
    end
  end
end

note right of System
  Network or API failures show an error
  message and return to the previous screen.
end note

@enduml
